{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "5bd45665d347ec5e432e6da7948363566acce8b26cacd9e6bd693f3d46a04560", "ja": "ウズウズな歌", "zh": "迫不及待的歌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d9ffd5d405ecda45375e5cd1f836b0400c063f467fb8bd38e2c84f3d925e3dd1", "ja": "社長から劇場発信の楽曲プロデュースを任さ\nれたプロデューサーは、楽曲のイメージに合\nわせてやよい、育、可奈、環の4人を選抜す\nる。サンプルを聴いた4人は大ハリキリ！", "zh": "受到社长的指派，制作人为了制作由剧场发行的\n歌曲，配合歌曲印象选出了弥生、育、可奈\n和环四个人。当她们听过试听版本之后都\n非常期待，跃跃欲试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "38b44814590ec2015b5f28187ecfe0f98e5697733e24fd29f6a5f7875d8ca4a5", "ja": "（新曲のデモを聞いて、数日後……）", "zh": "（听了新歌DEMO的数日后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "1e97a21d9b420cf1f3134ee3bfa6ea11c6c40d63bd0c31cf8b92de230f16d1cb", "ja": "{$P$}、\n私達にお話ってなんですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n你要和我们说什么事呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2824a2f2675eea523bf5b0181f93de40582c43832e6e14dbc6efbde679d5e962", "ja": "たまきも気になる！\nくふふ、何かな～、何かな～♪", "zh": "环也很好奇！\n呵呵，是什么呢～是什么呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "c7f3330a399e3bb3c4adec6f485287e8c5ad277d748eb78db27af24406a1ecbc", "ja": "嬉しいお知らせかな～♪　たとえば～……、\nお菓子コーナーに新しいラインナップが増える、とか！", "zh": "是令人开心的通知吧～♪例如说……\n点心区会增加新的点心种类，之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "3c5382360b4b15a7c792a717de561d43d451986c791aed3821f6b217be7d05c5", "ja": "可奈ちゃん、ほんと？\nだったらわたし、うれしいかも！", "zh": "可奈，真的吗？\n那我应该会很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2887e6af22a7e29c92d8ae52872582808719574168f53c5ab1669d71d24efa81", "ja": "いや、お菓子コーナーのことじゃなくてな。\n実は……。", "zh": "不，不是点心区的事，\n其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "014ffb62e9737a2a98a0b6b2fb31614529262e16da5890f5b96d658e0252f499", "ja": "えっ、違うんですか？\n残念です……しょんぼり。", "zh": "咦，不是吗？\n真可惜……好失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "1f687c87a278e005b75252f811681b12a25ab794063f7d4a1d7b008b7f60d335", "ja": "それじゃあ、どんなお話なの？", "zh": "不然是什么事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "e2f69146fa93449ce520c6bf9a29b01eafd03c55944117539d81b2fffbb13324", "ja": "はいはいはい！　たまき、わかったぞ！\nこれからみんなで公園に遊びに行くんでしょ？", "zh": "好好好！环知道了喔！\n等下大家要一起去公园玩对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "2ef376a1b55681a6a74606b628b0914fe7a8e8afb042a3162950468f2c275599", "ja": "環ちゃん、いま{$P$}が教えてくれる\nから、いい子にして待ってなくちゃ。ね？", "zh": "小环，{$P$}正要告诉大家，\n要乖乖等他说喔，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "0e847822def4c279d13c928753da0c674f4a08b447300f6ee16fdce72fc39394", "ja": "は～いっ。ごめんなさ～い！", "zh": "好～对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2e65198da22141d596a5905dea8d3e1345ef47d97938ee29c057a6b567d15f9b", "ja": "はは、やよい、ありがとう。\nそれじゃあ、話の続きをさせてもらうぞ。", "zh": "哈哈，弥生，谢谢你。\n那我就继续说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "66ff8ec08f9f74b086ac01ee88c02c79a4eaa95042ef03613ab0ba82eec378dc", "ja": "実は今度、この劇場発の新曲をリリースすることに\nなったんだ。", "zh": "其实我们决定要推出\n由剧场发行的新歌了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e85e8ef30934ad6d19ec9cee4b91b925a5b3595b4df9073ce4828d57d43373b5", "ja": "そして……その曲を、ここにいる4人に\n歌ってもらおうと思う！", "zh": "然后……我打算让在场的四个人\n来唱那首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "bd179d3fd5ba123157dc31919dd5f4e201a90dfef6d6c5d18f45ababed8fdc2f", "ja": "ええ～っ！", "zh": "咦咦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "bd179d3fd5ba123157dc31919dd5f4e201a90dfef6d6c5d18f45ababed8fdc2f", "ja": "ええ～っ！", "zh": "咦咦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "bd179d3fd5ba123157dc31919dd5f4e201a90dfef6d6c5d18f45ababed8fdc2f", "ja": "ええ～っ！", "zh": "咦咦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "bd179d3fd5ba123157dc31919dd5f4e201a90dfef6d6c5d18f45ababed8fdc2f", "ja": "ええ～っ！", "zh": "咦咦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "24b45ec3cba5d64aa68d5e3e18ec43682e38248caef9ed81ced06d8383a85811", "ja": "えっと、それってつまり……。\n私達4人で、CDを出すってことですか！？", "zh": "呃，意思就是……\n我们四个人要出CD吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "25e7696d0ac65d88f374bf6f3a35726898a571fb9c5e6186b92f3c32a5010f55", "ja": "そういうことだ。この曲を歌うなら、俺はこの4人……\nやよい、可奈、育、環以外にいないと思ったんだ。", "zh": "就是这么回事，弥生、可奈、育和环……\n我认为唱这首歌的人，非你们四个人莫属。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "483d83be57f52cae49015bae80909850afa0cb4e41f9b416b7d381e434ccbf06", "ja": "私達がCDを……！？　やった～っ！\n可奈はとってもハッピ～♪　お菓子よりうれし～♪", "zh": "我们要出CD……！？太好了～！\n可奈好Happy～♪比点心更开心～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "318d66b1aae02caf399a79e7d2d66ea820bfa300e209ab86e1b947267bf79263", "ja": "やよいと可奈は……引き受けてくれそうだな。\n育と環はどうだ？", "zh": "看来弥生和可奈……似乎愿意接受呢，\n育、环，你们呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "f3489863df0ca6abc18a3f8ba879f80808e7759c6efdb192c4c8ba28aaf5a072", "ja": "もちろん歌うよ！\nねえねえ、どんな曲なの？　早くききたい！", "zh": "当然要唱！\n欸欸，是什么样的歌？好想赶快听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "c4e8fdc75f9d2b953916fa56fe07126ab4afedfc3fd3455c7d79efcb9446d0a9", "ja": "たまきもたまきも！\nくふふ……楽しみだぞ～♪", "zh": "环也是环也是！\n呵呵……真期待喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "3be87f92d31a8835694e9cb86ed7b5f0fee6e7194d0bdd1dab99602b472ebbc5", "ja": "はは、そういうと思って、曲のサンプルを\n持ってきたよ。早速、みんなで聴いてみよう！", "zh": "哈哈，我就猜到会这样，所以把试听带\n给带来了喔，大家赶快听听看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "2b21ec75a6a42fcc6e71a63912beb851a025759e283a7bd6e186cf8a52c2de11", "ja": "これが私達が歌う曲……\nうっうー！　すっごくかわいいですー！", "zh": "这就是我们要唱的歌……\n呜呜──！好可爱喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "6e592336d3a7165a2a4fc99fe91616d7107d00cf3f333ca2511aa845cd8bc579", "ja": "うん！　とってもやさしい歌だよねっ。\nわたし、きいてたら胸がポカポカしてきちゃった！", "zh": "嗯！是一首非常温柔的歌呢！\n听了之后我心里都暖洋洋的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4663bf518ef19ebebfbfd7f027f320601712f8ea34c820575212986f75ba1326", "ja": "みんな気に入ってくれたみたいで、よかったよ。", "zh": "看来大家都喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "581e55e460334859ce980b23bd3872c2b5a9638f36aa9010b7bf8f14dd96663e", "ja": "CDの収録に、リリース公演……これから\n忙しくなると思うけど、みんなで協力していこう！", "zh": "CD录音和发片公演……我想未来\n应该会越来越忙，大家要互相帮忙喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "0c6dae11a04aabb03109228fd9f8b6be8a063917e88a1cdd413066d752e10c4f", "ja": "おやぶん、まかせて！\nたまき、いっぱい頑張っちゃうぞ～！", "zh": "老大，交给环吧！\n环会好好努力的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "b0e7e9106b0c0d5491336dfc33e16f27b435389416175eabbca6c5e2969ed1a7", "ja": "私も～っ！　いけいけ、可奈～♪　ちょとつも～しん♪\nも～も～し～ん♪　全力で、いきまーす！", "zh": "我也是～！上吧上吧，可奈～♪向前～冲♪\n冲～冲～冲♪全力以赴──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1035_005yay", "source_sha256": "a9076c47b2c38d661faa1dd80898f939e08871142fd1ae88b9f5a38d5d651b86", "ja": "よ～し！　それじゃあ、みんなで、頑張ろうの……\nハイ、ターッチ！", "zh": "好啊～！那我们要一起努力……\n好，击──掌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_01_1036_005yay", "source_sha256": "ee8aeb91a8721738862e0e4ea07080e88bdbdae600fb2b50f9bfcdf2de19b52d", "ja": "いぇ～い！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
